# Heavy / regenerable validation artifacts (reproduce via README).
sofia_out/
out/*.png

# The root .gitignore has a blanket `out/` rule, which would swallow this
# directory whole — git does not descend into an excluded directory, so the
# negation must re-include the directory FIRST and re-exclude its contents.
# The small metric tables are the paper's traceable artifacts and belong in the
# repo: a number quoted in the text must be checkable without re-running SoFiA.
!out/
out/*
!out/*.md
!out/*.csv
